  "summary": "The GDA 4022 is a two-channel gas detection controller whose isolated RS-485 port runs as a Modbus RTU slave by default. Gas concentrations are input registers, alarm states and the system fault are coils, and configuration (gas type, units, alarm behaviour, location names, mA outputs) sits in holding registers. All values are 16-bit, signed unless the document says otherwise.",
